cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use qubitlab, please cite it as below."
title: "Qubit Lab: an open-source simulator for learning superconducting qubits"
version: 1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: Reddy
    given-names: Pranav
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/pkarakala/qubit-lab"
abstract: >-
  An interactive simulator for learning superconducting qubits (cat qubits and
  transmons), where every equation is cited to its paper and checked against an
  open-system simulation built on Dynamiqs, scqubits, Stim, PyMatching and JAX.
keywords:
  - superconducting qubits
  - cat qubits
  - transmon
  - quantum error correction
  - education
